    "n8nWorkflowId": "8Shw97zD18yNiD2X",
    "notes": "Pattern adapted (read-only reference) from Mivos.ai's n8n_email_webhook_workflow.json — a separate workflow ('Mivos CRM Inbound Email Bridge') on the same n8n instance, confirmed not shared. Live as workflow id 8Shw97zD18yNiD2X on https://n8n.srv946115.hstgr.cloud/, activated 2026-08-11. The IMAP node uses 'admin@homequotelink.com - IMAP account' (n8n credential id LGYS3R4mIZTgmMom) — the same mailbox outreach sends from, which is what makes replies and bounces visible to it. YOUR_INBOUND_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_TOKEN is a PLACEHOLDER and must stay one: the real value is a secret, held in n8n's own copy of this workflow and in the Supabase INBOUND_EMAIL_WEBHOOK_TOKEN secret (rotated 2026-08-11), and must never be committed here. To update the live workflow, fill the token in a local copy and PUT to /api/v1/workflows/8Shw97zD18yNiD2X — updating in place rather than creating a second workflow. `message_id` is optional; the receiving function falls back to a composite key from sender+subject+body if the IMAP node's messageId field is unavailable."
  },
